self.KB_CONTENT["card:779263"]={"id":"card:779263","ty":"card","sourceId":"779263","title":"『成本開帳/調整單建立作業(IDL)』中的『廠別 (TJ005)』為何？","ver":"GP4以上","topic":"廠別","keywords":["廠別","一筆","開帳","別名"],"y":"other","answer":"* 不可空白。* 預設「廠別資料檔」的第一筆，連續新增時預設前一筆廠別。* 可點選(icon)或[F2]廠別資料查詢(CMSMB-01)，並顯示廠別名稱。","links":[],"pdfText":"","pdfPages":0,"pdfChars":0,"merged":[],"file":"kb-cards.jsonl"};
self.KB_CONTENT["card:779300"]={"id":"card:779300","ty":"card","sourceId":"779300","title":"『轉撥單據建立作業(IDL)』中的『部門代號 (TA004)』為何？","ver":"GP4以上","topic":"轉撥","keywords":["轉撥"],"y":"other","answer":"* 可點選(icon)或[F2]部門資料查詢(CMSME-01)，並顯示部門名稱。","links":[],"pdfText":"","pdfPages":0,"pdfChars":0,"merged":[],"file":"kb-cards.jsonl"};
self.KB_CONTENT["card:778462"]={"id":"card:778462","ty":"card","sourceId":"778462","title":"『批次生產計劃明細表』中的『選擇鎖定狀態』為何？","ver":"GP4以上","topic":"明細表","keywords":["明細表","生產","狀態","計劃"],"y":"other","answer":"* 列印的鎖定條件。預設「已鎖定」狀態。* 分別有Y.已鎖定、N.未鎖定及全部三種。","links":[],"pdfText":"","pdfPages":0,"pdfChars":0,"merged":[],"file":"kb-cards.jsonl"};
self.KB_CONTENT["card:779623"]={"id":"card:779623","ty":"card","sourceId":"779623","title":"『委外工單開立』中的『備註A (TG013)』為何？","ver":"GP4以上","topic":"備註","keywords":["備註","複製","工單","開立"],"y":"other","answer":"* 可點選(icon)或[F2]片語資料查詢。* [F3]複製備註。* 每行上限寬度為 70字元，最多輸入255字元，超過255以255存入。","links":[],"pdfText":"","pdfPages":0,"pdfChars":0,"merged":[],"file":"kb-cards.jsonl"};
self.KB_CONTENT["card:779649"]={"id":"card:779649","ty":"card","sourceId":"779649","title":"『委外廠商月結請款作業』的作業目的為何？","ver":"GP4以上","topic":"應付憑單","keywords":["應付憑單","廠商"],"y":"explain","answer":"由委外廠商月結請款作業來產生應付憑單。","links":[],"pdfText":"","pdfPages":0,"pdfChars":0,"merged":[],"file":"kb-cards.jsonl"};
